# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AUGUST 2026 - /local-seo/* moved to /property-management-seo/*
#
# These are duplicated in netlify.toml on purpose. Whichever file Netlify
# resolves first, the redirect fires. Do not "clean up" the duplication -
# it is the belt and braces that stopped eleven URLs 404ing once already.
#
# ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING. These MUST stay above the /* fallback below, because
# Netlify stops at the first match. Anything under that line is unreachable.
#
# 301 with ! (force) so it wins even against a matching static file.
# Do not delete these when the old URLs leave Search Console - external links
# and bookmarks outlive Google's index.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/local-seo                 /property-management-seo/locations/   301!
/local-seo/                /property-management-seo/locations/   301!
/local-seo/*               /property-management-seo/:splat       301!


